<mjml>
  <mj-head>
    <mj-title>PyConZA</mj-title>
    <mj-font
      name="Oswald"
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css?family=Oswald"
    ></mj-font>
    <mj-attributes>
      <mj-text font-family="Verdana, Aerial"></mj-text>
      <mj-class
        name="heading-1"
        font-family="Oswald, Trebuchet MS, Arial"
        font-size="40px"
        color="#1B2E4E"
        font-style="bold"
      />
      <mj-class
        name="heading-2"
        font-family="Oswald, Trebuchet MS, Arial"
        font-size="30px"
        color="#1B2E4E"
        font-style="bold"
      />
      <mj-class
        name="heading-3"
        font-family="Oswald, Trebuchet MS, Arial"
        font-size="20px"
        color="#1B2E4E"
        font-style="bold"
      />
      <mj-class
        name="action-button"
        background-color="#C32E66"
        color="#EDDDC4"
      />
      <mj-class
        name="body-section"
        background-color="#EDDDC4"
        color="#1B2E4E"
      />
      <mj-class
        name="blurb"
        container-background-color="#E2BD90"
        font-style="italic"
      />
    </mj-attributes>
    <mj-style> a { color: #c32e66; } a:hover { color: #ff8c42; } </mj-style>
  </mj-head>
  <mj-body>
    <!-- title header -->
    <mj-section background-color="#EDDDC4">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text align="center" mj-class="heading-1"> PYCONZA 2026 </mj-text>
        <mj-text align="center" mj-class="heading-2">
          Rondebosch, Cape Town, 14-16 October 2026
        </mj-text>
        <mj-image
          src="https://d33xevxtx8rl5e.cloudfront.net/email-header.png"
          alt="PyConZA logo"
          href="https://za.pycon.org/"
        />
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <!-- body -->


<mj-section mj-class="body-section">
  <mj-column>
    <mj-text mj-class="heading-2"
      >Beginners day tutorial now available!</mj-text
    >
    <mj-text>
      Thanks to Sheena O'Connell, we will be hosting a free* beginners day
      tutorial, featuring the Humble Data Syllabus:
      <a href="https://humbledata.org/">https://humbledata.org/</a>.
    </mj-text>
    <mj-text>
      To attend, you will need to purchase a R50 refundable ticket. This
      tutorial is designed for complete beginners in both Python and
      programming, particularly those who could not learn programming before.
      Please book soon, as we have limited capacity!
    </mj-text>
    <mj-button
      mj-class="action-button"
      href="https://za.pycon.org/pages/tickets/buy-tickets/"
      >Get your ticket</mj-button
    >
  </mj-column>
</mj-section>
<mj-section mj-class="body-section">
  <mj-column>
    <mj-text mj-class="heading-2">Keynote by Paul Everitt</mj-text>
    <mj-text>
      We are now finalizing all our talks, and our first Keynote has been locked
      in! It is by Paul Everitt, titled
      <strong
        >"Was, Is, Will Be: Python History, Software Engineering, And AI Our
        Way"</strong
      >.
    </mj-text>
    <mj-text mj-class="blurb">
      JetBrains developer advocate, Zope Corporation co-founder, and one of the
      people who got the #PSF started.
    </mj-text>
    <mj-text mj-class="blurb">
      AI fatigue? Paul will cover Python's story, our power, and a plan.
    </mj-text>
    <mj-image
      src="https://d33xevxtx8rl5e.cloudfront.net/paul.jpg"
      alt="PyConZA logo"
      href="https://za.pycon.org/pages/tickets/buy-tickets/"
    />
  </mj-column>
</mj-section>
<mj-section mj-class="body-section">
  <mj-column>
    <mj-text mj-class="heading-2">Makers room!</mj-text>
    <mj-text>
      If you would like to show off something you've made, or use to make
      things, we have a makers room available throughout the whole conference!
    </mj-text>
    <mj-text>
      It will be available for anyone to bring their things, no registration
      required. The room will be locked after hours for security.
    </mj-text>
  </mj-column>
</mj-section>



    <!-- footer -->
    <mj-section background-color="#1B2E4E">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-social>
          <mj-social-element
            href="https://twitter.com/pyconza"
            src="https://d3q92ym5gvt1q6.cloudfront.net/twitter.png"
          >
          </mj-social-element>
          <mj-social-element
            href="https://fosstodon.org/@pyconza"
            src="https://d3q92ym5gvt1q6.cloudfront.net/mastodon.png"
          >
          </mj-social-element>
        </mj-social>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <!-- sub footer -->

    <mj-section>
      <mj-column>
        <mj-image
          width="250px"
          src="https://d33xevxtx8rl5e.cloudfront.net/thinkst_logo_footer.svg"
          href="https://canary.tools/"
          alt="Thinkst Canary"
        />
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
    <mj-section>
      <mj-column>
        <mj-image
          width="250px"
          src="https://d33xevxtx8rl5e.cloudfront.net/OfferZen_logo_Colour.png"
          href="https://www.offerzen.com/?utm_campaign=za-demand-engagement-community-all-demand-personas-oz-sponsored-conferences-q4&utm_content=pycon-za&utm_source=event"
          alt="OfferZen"
        />
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
    <mj-section>
      <mj-column>
        <mj-image
          width="120px"
          src="https://d33xevxtx8rl5e.cloudfront.net/esp.svg"
          href="https://esp.info/"
          alt="ESP"
        />
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
    <mj-section>
      <mj-column>
        <mj-image
          width="120px"
          src="https://d33xevxtx8rl5e.cloudfront.net/Naughty_Bean_Coffee.webp"
          href="https://naughtybean.coffee/"
          alt="Naughty Bean Coffee"
        />
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
    <mj-section>
      <mj-column>
        <mj-image
          width="150px"
          src="https://d33xevxtx8rl5e.cloudfront.net/SerpApi_Logo_with_Wordmark_-_Dark.png"
          href="https://www.serpapi.com/?utm=pyconza"
          alt="SerpAPI"
        />
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section background-color="#1B2E4E">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text color="#EDDDC4" font-size="12px">
          {{company_info_name}}
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text color="#EDDDC4" font-size="12px">
          {{company_info_address}}
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section>
      <mj-column>
        <mj-button href="__unsubscribe_url__"> Unsubscribe </mj-button>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
  </mj-body>
</mjml>
